const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"自动执行不等于没有中介职能",en:"Automation does not remove intermediation functions"},body:{zh:"Aramonte、Huang与Schrimpf区分由智能合约执行的DeFi与依赖平台内部记录的CeFi。两者都可能提供交易或借贷，但记录位置、治理与交易执行方式不同。把所有加密活动合成一个指标，会掩盖这些关键差异。",en:"Aramonte, Huang and Schrimpf distinguish smart-contract DeFi from CeFi based on intermediaries' private records. Both can support trading or lending, but records, governance and execution differ. A single aggregate crypto indicator hides these distinctions."},reference:{url:"https://www.bis.org/publications/defi-risks-and-decentralisation-illusion",label:{zh:"2021年12月BIS专题 · Overview",en:"December 2021 BIS feature · Overview"}}},{title:{zh:"稳定币会把链上与链下连接起来",en:"Stablecoins link on-chain and off-chain arrangements"},body:{zh:"专题把稳定币视为不同平台之间转移资金的重要工具，但区分链下管理储备与链上抵押机制。合约运行在链上，并不证明它依赖的资产、赎回安排或管理权也完全在链上；研究必须沿着这些依赖继续核对。",en:"Stablecoins facilitate transfers across platforms, but off-chain reserve management differs from on-chain collateral. A contract running on-chain does not establish that its backing assets, redemption arrangements or control are entirely on-chain. Follow those dependencies when evaluating the structure."},reference:{url:"https://www.bis.org/publications/defi-risks-and-decentralisation-illusion",label:{zh:"2021年12月BIS专题 · Building blocks",en:"December 2021 BIS feature · Building blocks"}}},{title:{zh:"代码无法预先写完所有治理选择",en:"Code cannot pre-specify every governance decision"},body:{zh:"作者用算法不完备解释治理需求：新业务、升级和未预见情况仍需有人作决定。治理代币的投票权与实际持有集中度因此重要，不能只凭“去中心化”的标签判断谁能改变协议，或把地址数量等同于独立决策者数量。",en:"Algorithm incompleteness motivates governance: upgrades, new activities and unforeseen contingencies still require decisions. Voting rights and ownership concentration matter. A decentralized label does not identify who can change a protocol, and address counts do not count independent decision makers."},reference:{url:"https://www.bis.org/publications/defi-risks-and-decentralisation-illusion",label:{zh:"2021年12月BIS专题 · Decentralisation illusion",en:"December 2021 BIS feature · Decentralisation illusion"}}},{title:{zh:"超额抵押也可能形成杠杆链",en:"Overcollateralization can coexist with leverage chains"},body:{zh:"即使单笔借款有超额抵押，借出的资金仍可能被用于另一笔抵押和借款，扩大整体暴露。抵押物下跌触发减仓，又可能加重价格下跌。只看某一个仓位的抵押率，会遗漏跨协议的重复使用和共同价格风险。",en:"A loan can be overcollateralized while its proceeds support further collateral and borrowing elsewhere. Falling collateral prices may prompt deleveraging that adds selling pressure. One position's collateral ratio misses reuse across protocols and common price exposure."},reference:{url:"https://www.bis.org/publications/defi-risks-and-decentralisation-illusion",label:{zh:"2021年12月BIS专题 · Vulnerabilities · Leverage",en:"December 2021 BIS feature · Vulnerabilities · Leverage"}}},{title:{zh:"储备风险与赎回承诺要一起看",en:"Read reserve risk alongside redemption promises"},body:{zh:"稳定币储备可能面临市场价格风险或变现困难，而持有人希望按面值退出。信任下降时，先赎回者优势可能促成挤兑。不同储备设计的脆弱性不相同，不能因为价格暂时稳定，就认为赎回权、流动性和偿付能力都已得到证明。",en:"Reserve assets may be volatile or hard to liquidate while holders expect par redemption. Declining trust can create incentives to exit first. Designs differ, and a temporarily stable market price does not prove redemption rights, liquidity or solvency."},reference:{url:"https://www.bis.org/publications/defi-risks-and-decentralisation-illusion",label:{zh:"2021年12月BIS专题 · Vulnerabilities · Liquidity mismatches",en:"December 2021 BIS feature · Vulnerabilities · Liquidity mismatches"}}},{title:{zh:"研究应追踪依赖，而不只追踪币价",en:"Trace dependencies, not only token prices"},body:{zh:"专题关注抵押链、稳定币资金连接和共同融资如何传播压力。编辑建议保存协议与版本、抵押资产、清算条件、储备披露及时间戳。交易所行情不能描述这些关系；相同代币价格也不意味着不同协议面对相同的清算与赎回约束。",en:"The feature examines collateral chains, stablecoin connections and funding links as transmission channels. Editorial application: preserve protocols and versions, collateral, liquidation terms, reserve disclosures and timestamps. Exchange prices cannot describe these relationships; identical token prices do not imply identical liquidation or redemption constraints."},reference:{url:"https://www.bis.org/publications/defi-risks-and-decentralisation-illusion",label:{zh:"2021年12月BIS专题 · Vulnerabilities · Spillovers",en:"December 2021 BIS feature · Vulnerabilities · Spillovers"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"这是2021年BIS专题对当时DeFi结构的分析，不是当前协议排名、安全审计或监管结论。中心化交易所的资金费率和持仓量，不能替代链上抵押、治理和稳定币储备材料。",en:"This 2021 BIS feature analyzes the ecosystem of its time, not current protocol rankings, security or regulation. Centralized-exchange funding rates and open interest cannot substitute for on-chain collateral, governance and stablecoin reserve evidence."}};export{e as default};
